{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated","id":882498,"title":"New Anathema Character Management - Anathema Reincarnated","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-04T20:41:41-07:00","id":882498,"title":"New Anathema Character Management - Anathema Reincarnated","content":"So, I feel a bit nervous making this announcement, perhaps a bit presumptuous, but, I and a friend of mine (Kenai on these forums) have been working to finish Urskr's work on a version of Anathema for Third Edition Exalted.<br /> <br /> We call it &quot;Anathema Reincarnated&quot; and it is currently well on it's way to its first, official version. Until then, we wanted to get people excited for the finished application, with this;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://bitbucket.org/blakwurm/anathema-reincarnated/downloads\" target=\"_blank\">https://bitbucket.org/blakwurm/anath...ated/downloads</a><br /> <br /> It's a link to our teaser for Anathema; a complete combat tracker! Do you sometimes have difficulty tracking your circle's essence, health, initiative and so on? Then, you can make use of this simple application! All it requires to run is Java 8 or newer. Simply download the file and run; you can currently save combatants, manage stats and healthtracks, and even run most of the combat calculations. It still requires some manual function; battlegroups don't automatically calculate the additional damage from being attacked decisively, for instance, but for the most part you can easily speed up combat with this function of our new app.<br /> <br /> Although we aren't part of the Anathema team, we have the utmost respect for them and Urskr's work, and, given that his version of Anathema has been shelved for the time being, possibly forever, we hope that we can give back to the Exalted community as much as they and the game alike have given back to us.<br /> <br /> More features are on the horizon, so check back regularly. We intend for Anathema Reincarnated to be a useful tool for STs and players alike.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 05-04-2016, 11:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":15}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T20:44:56-07:00","id":882502,"title":"","content":"Getting an access denied error.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Pronounced &quot;Monkey Pie&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/762726-actual-play-the-party-prelude-project\" target=\"_blank\">Find my actual play content here!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/656-monkipi","name":"Monkipi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar656_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"318"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T20:48:51-07:00","id":882506,"title":"","content":"Try again, Kenai said he just fixed it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T20:49:14-07:00","id":882507,"title":"","content":"Should be working. I had forgotten to set the repo to &quot;public&quot;.<br /> <br /> With that out of the way...<br /> <br /> Hey folks. Please let us know what you think of the demo app. It's been a fun experience developing it so far, and I'm very much looking forward to hearing what the community thinks about it.<br /> <br /> If you have Java/Kotlin chops and are interested in helping, please let me know!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:35:24-07:00","id":882528,"title":"","content":"Ooh, how exciting! I was a bit worried that the prior project had died some ignominious death, but here it is, rising from the ashes, so to speak.<br /> <br /> I wish I could code to help you guys out, but all I'm good for is waiting with baited breath.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:47:51-07:00","id":882537,"title":"","content":"How do you install it? Is it the same as the instructions in Anathema thread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2626-yzarc","name":"Yzarc","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2626_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:48:00-07:00","id":882538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882528#post882528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ooh, how exciting! I was a bit worried that the prior project had died some ignominious death, but here it is, rising from the ashes, so to speak.<br /> <br /> I wish I could code to help you guys out, but all I'm good for is waiting with baited breath.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200bWe're glad to hear, and honestly feared much the same thing. We kind of think of Urskr and his team as our first age predecessor, but now we're back and ready to take the age of sorrows on by storm <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yzarc</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882537#post882537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do you install it? Is it the same as the instructions in Anathema thread?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh heck no, it's a lot simpler than that. Just make sure you've got a copy of Java 8 (if you play Minecraft you probably already do.) and just download the Fat.Jar (Yes I know it's a funny name but it's a technical term) and doubleclick.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":".  Combined Posts 05-05-2016, 12:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:49:51-07:00","id":882539,"title":"","content":"Wow. Nice work.<br /> <br /> I might be able to help a little. My programming skills are very limited, though, so don't expect me to do anything interesting.<br /> <br /> What kind of help do you need, anyway?<br /> <br /> PS: IIRC one of the Kickstarter stretch goals was some kind of official support for Anathema. Are you guys getting that support too?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:56:10-07:00","id":882544,"title":"","content":"We've asked Holden and Urskr for their blessings but received no word as of yet. I'm assuming they haven't been in on their accounts yet.<br /> <br /> As for help, talk to Kenai.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:56:40-07:00","id":882545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882528#post882528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wish I could code to help you guys out, but all I'm good for is waiting with baited breath.</div> </div> </div> </div>I sincerely appreciate the sentiment, and you're good for a lot more than that! One way that you can be useful is to try using it in your game this weekend and let us know it it went! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> (Or, if you don't have a game going, then you can poke around and see if you can find any bugs!)<br /> <br /> If you want to learn how to code (a hobby that I highly recommend, for a great many reasons), let me point you in the right direction- <a href=\"http://mooc.fi/courses/2013/programming-part-1/\" target=\"_blank\">http://mooc.fi/courses/2013/programming-part-1/</a><br /> <br /> I took this course one year ago, and the reincarnation of Anathema is a direct result of the knowledge that I gained either from the course itself or from what I read after.<br /> <br /> If you decide to take the course, let me know what your username is so that I can see where you are in the stats! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T21:57:04-07:00","id":882546,"title":"","content":"Oh, that's a nifty little tracker. Hope to see more from you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T22:11:36-07:00","id":882558,"title":"","content":"So, what kind of blessings do you need and how many bulls do I have to sacrifice to Ahlat for them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/K9a6Pmp.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/998-korhal_iv","name":"Korhal_IV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"592"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T22:17:44-07:00","id":882567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882539#post882539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What kind of help do you need, anyway?</div> </div> </div> </div>Right now we need help with unit testing. All of my development time has been spent adding features, and I have completely neglected automated testing. If you help get unit tests up and running, and keep involved with the testing process, dev time will be considerably sped up and the quality of the app will stay high! Not exactly a flashy job, but it's an important one that I don't have much time for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T22:17:47-07:00","id":882568,"title":"","content":"A hecatomb would be nice. A man's gotta eat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T22:27:32-07:00","id":882572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korhal_IV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882558#post882558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, what kind of blessings do you need and how many bulls do I have to sacrifice to Ahlat for them?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't want any blessings from Ahlat. If you could get me a blessing from <i>Luna</i> or <i>Sol Invictus,</i> on the other hand...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":6102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","user":"Kenai","date":". 05-05-2016, 01:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T00:15:35-07:00","id":882628,"title":"","content":"Consider me a tester. I'll get it set up on my PC at home to run my live game and also adjudicate my for funzies tournament so there will be a lot of testing done over the next few weeks. <br /> <br /> I'll let you know in here if I run into any issues.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T01:26:53-07:00","id":882674,"title":"","content":"Thanks much. We look forward to the feedback.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T04:23:38-07:00","id":882759,"title":"","content":"Wasn't Anathema an official stretch goal? Or was it just one of those things that they couldn't find anyone who wanted to program it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T04:40:19-07:00","id":882770,"title":"","content":"The whole of the official support seems to be to get the Anathema developers the rules a bit before official release so they can have a headstart.<br /> <br /> Thats what I understand from the subject.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T06:58:38-07:00","id":882830,"title":"","content":"Well, we last heard from Urskr on the present state of Anathema only about 2 months ago, and the code is actually public on github for anyone who wants to take the pre-existing codebase and work on it<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e\" target=\"_blank\"> https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> So, I'm not convinced that Anathema is quite dead yet...but it would be nice to see more options pop up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3937-guildsbounty","name":"guildsbounty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T07:10:25-07:00","id":882836,"title":"","content":"is there a way to get this to work on the Mac? forgive me for being someone inept at this, any help would be appriciated","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T07:16:31-07:00","id":882840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TGUEIROS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882770#post882770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The whole of the official support seems to be to get the Anathema developers the rules a bit before official release so they can have a headstart.<br /> <br /> Thats what I understand from the subject.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is true. The money from KS was to hire a &quot;go-between&quot; for passing along rules while it was in development. Now that the game is &quot;out&quot; I don't know what official support is needed. All the rules are there for the extracting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T07:20:38-07:00","id":882845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882840#post882840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is true. The money from KS was to hire a &quot;go-between&quot; for passing along rules while it was in development. Now that the game is &quot;out&quot; I don't know what official support is needed. All the rules are there for the extracting.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, if Anathema had been released soon after the official release (actually it is still &quot;soon after&quot;, so hope springs eternal), there would be a great deal more rejoicing. But Urskr seems to be quite busy at the moment, and if some talented fans want to get Anathema into my hands quicker with the official rules, I say all the blessings of the Unconquered Sun to them.<br /> <br /> prototype00","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T07:42:25-07:00","id":882861,"title":"","content":"Hey, if you need a java dev to help, I'm available to help. Unit testing, you say?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T09:43:24-07:00","id":882933,"title":"","content":"Did you include this pull request in the code you built from? <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e/pull/1\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e/pull/1</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T09:51:49-07:00","id":882938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882836#post882836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">is there a way to get this to work on the Mac? forgive me for being someone inept at this, any help would be appriciated</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll talk to Kenai and see if we can do anything. No promises though, neither of us are very familiar with Mac.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AtG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882933#post882933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did you include this pull request in the code you built from? <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e/pull/1\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e/pull/1</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I suppose the cat's out of the bag, actually...<br /> <br /> To be entirely honest, we didn't actually use any of Urskr's code. This version of Anathema is actually entirely coded by Kenai using his stuff, or google library code.<br /> <br /> Basically, Urs' code uses a very different paradigm than what Kenai uses, which is also why Kenai is of the opinion that it's what slowed down development of the original Anathema. We began coding this version of Anathema less than 3 months ago. He's been working on it in earnest for slightly more than 5 weeks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 05-05-2016, 01:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T10:02:02-07:00","id":882954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882836#post882836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">is there a way to get this to work on the Mac? forgive me for being someone inept at this, any help would be appriciated</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't have a Mac for testing, but as far as I know you should just be able to run it (assuming that you have Java 8 or newer installed).<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pcontop</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882861#post882861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, if you need a java dev to help, I'm available to help. Unit testing, you say?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep! Drop me a PM with your skype contact info!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882845#post882845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But Urskr seems to be quite busy at the moment, and if some talented fans want to get Anathema into my hands quicker with the official rules, I say all the blessings of the Unconquered Sun to them</div> </div> </div> </div>That basically sums up why I'm doing this. We need Anathema for our Friday game, and I have some massive issues with the GNU GPL... so I'm making a new version. If anything, I'm hoping that this takes some of the pressure off of Urskr. He's an incredibly important figure in the Exalted community, and I find the thought of his burnout disturbing (from a human interest point of view).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T10:02:54-07:00","id":882956,"title":"","content":"Ah hmm I'll try ? It didn't seem to work when I tried it earlier","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T10:26:19-07:00","id":882985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882956#post882956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah hmm I'll try ? It didn't seem to work when I tried it earlier</div> </div> </div> </div>If you still can't get it working, pm me. Once we get a fix going I'll make it an official part of the project.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T11:04:17-07:00","id":883031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882938#post882938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suppose the cat's out of the bag, actually...<br /> <br /> To be entirely honest, we didn't actually use any of Urskr's code. This version of Anathema is actually entirely coded by Kenai using his stuff, or google library code.<br /> <br /> Basically, Urs' code uses a very different paradigm than what Kenai uses, which is also why Kenai is of the opinion that it's what slowed down development of the original Anathema. We began coding this version of Anathema less than 3 months ago. He's been working on it in earnest for slightly more than 5 weeks.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yes I am familiar with Urs' codebase, and if you are writing a new system I don't think there is any problem with starting over.<br /> <br /> (This isn't intended as snark, Anathema is just like any other long-running software project.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T11:11:37-07:00","id":883038,"title":"","content":"Are you still going to use XML for the charm library?<br /> <br /> Also, if you are not using any of the original code, it may be a good idea to rename the project.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-05-2016, 02:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T12:30:38-07:00","id":883106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883038#post883038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you still going to use XML for the charm library?<br /> <br /> Also, if you are not using any of the original code, it may be a good idea to rename the project.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually we've written our own file format for them. I'm of course only the design and rules consultant guy, so Kenai could explain better than I.<br /> <br /> As for the name, well that's why the full title is &quot;Anathema Reincarnated&quot; rather than just &quot;Anathema 3&quot;. Reincarnated, in the same sense as &quot;Redux&quot; or &quot;Remastered&quot; or well, any variation of a single word that starts in R that usually comes after a title. Not in the same sense as Revengeance though <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AtG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883031#post883031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh yes I am familiar with Urs' codebase, and if you are writing a new system I don't think there is any problem with starting over.<br /> <br /> (This isn't intended as snark, Anathema is just like any other long-running software project.)</div> </div> </div> </div>By which you mean it tends to carry alot of baggage that can often complicate things, much in the same sense that the Exalted Devs started the new edition over basically from first principles?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T12:54:34-07:00","id":883128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883106#post883106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By which you mean it tends to carry alot of baggage that can often complicate things, much in the same sense that the Exalted Devs started the new edition over basically from first principles?</div> </div> </div> </div>That, and it's particularly committed to a specific architecture that's grown complex and takes a decent amount of time to figure out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T14:21:30-07:00","id":883199,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kenai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=882567#post882567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Right now we need help with unit testing. All of my development time has been spent adding features, and I have completely neglected automated testing. If you help get unit tests up and running, and keep involved with the testing process, dev time will be considerably sped up and the quality of the app will stay high! Not exactly a flashy job, but it's an important one that I don't have much time for.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have an exalted game on Saturday. I will try running this now and see if I can track any bugs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1401-rungok","name":"rungok","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1401_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T14:41:01-07:00","id":883215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AtG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883128#post883128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That, and it's particularly committed to a specific architecture that's grown complex and takes a decent amount of time to figure out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why sir, are you a Haxxor? ;p","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T17:25:57-07:00","id":883332,"title":"","content":"I'm also building a combat tracker, but it's web-based: <a href=\"http://bartkusa.com/ex/\" target=\"_blank\">http://bartkusa.com/ex/</a>.<br /> <br /> I'm a bit overwhelmed by your UI, but I'm really excited by how many more features you have than me (eg health, battlegroups, willpower)! Very cool.<br /> <br /> Maybe one day we can work together! It'd be cool if we could import/export data between our apps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11471-bartkusa","name":"bartkusa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11471_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T17:36:30-07:00","id":883336,"title":"","content":"I keep thinking about building a Charm Database with an API for other people's apps, but I keep deciding that is too much like my job. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T18:23:16-07:00","id":883365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bartkusa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883332#post883332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm also building a combat tracker, but it's web-based: <a href=\"http://bartkusa.com/ex/\" target=\"_blank\">http://bartkusa.com/ex/</a>.<br /> <br /> I'm a bit overwhelmed by your UI, but I'm really excited by how many more features you have than me (eg health, battlegroups, willpower)! Very cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good job, and thank you! I rushed to get the tracker functional first and foremost, so usability/polish suffered a little bit. If you have CSS chops, maybe you could help us with JavaFX skinning!<br /> <br /> A note about health- don't feel bad about not having it. Storyteller Health is hard. If you PM me your skype or whatsapp details, I can explain how I did it, but I had to embrace the <a href=\"https://xkcd.com/323/\" target=\"_blank\">Ballmer peak </a>before I could crack that particular egg.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bartkusa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883332#post883332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe one day we can work together! It'd be cool if we could import/export data between our apps.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883336#post883336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep thinking about building a Charm Database with an API for other people's apps, but I keep deciding that is too much like my job. :P</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm already thinking along those lines, my friends. Google GSON + use of <a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/reference/data-classes.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kotlin data classes</a> means that I can quite easily share data around. I won't publically release a Chronicle editor until I'm done with Sorcery and Martial arts (at which point I'll be ready to release an alpha version of the solar tracker), but once I do it will be rather easy to get custom stuff into computer-usable form. In the meanwhile, feel free to branch the repo if you want to play around with what I already have.<br /> <br /> For reference, <a href=\"https://bitbucket.org/blakwurm/anathema-reincarnated/src/df9a26b53ba78da0d82e5bd4afabdb95c8abf79c/src/main/resources/bookdata/testing.chron?at=master&amp;fileviewer=file-view-default\" target=\"_blank\">here's the crappy testing .chron file that I'm using to develop the Solar Tracker</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T18:30:25-07:00","id":883367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kenai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883365#post883365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good job, and thank you! I rushed to get the tracker functional first and foremost, so usability/polish suffered a little bit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you made the right choice. First make it, then make it better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11471-bartkusa","name":"bartkusa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11471_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T18:45:18-07:00","id":883371,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kenai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883365#post883365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm already thinking along those lines, my friends. Google GSON + use of <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://kotlinlang.org/docs/reference/data-classes.html&amp;quot;]Kotlin</a> data classes[/URL] means that I can quite easily share data around. I won't publically release a Chronicle editor until I'm done with Sorcery and Martial arts (at which point I'll be ready to release an alpha version of the solar tracker), but once I do it will be rather easy to get custom stuff into computer-usable form. In the meanwhile, feel free to branch the repo if you want to play around with what I already have.<br /> <br /> For reference, <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://bitbucket.org/blakwurm/anathema-reincarnated/src/df9a26b53ba78da0d82e5bd4afabdb95c8abf79c/src/main/resources/bookdata/testing.chron?at=master&amp;fileviewer=file-view-default&amp;quot;]here's</a> the crappy testing .chron file that I'm using to develop the Solar Tracker[/URL]</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll admit I'm a really bad developer. I have not done any coding besides perl scripting since VB. Net in grad school about five years ago. Working for our corporate overlords has made my skills rusty. <br /> <br /> My idea was a mySQL database with Web service. Other developers can use the API to pull the charms into thier apps. If someone wants to develop an android app, they already got the charms, spells, martial arts, etc. I got some very rough notes on a database design. I just don't have time! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T16:06:04-07:00","id":884139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=883371#post883371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll admit I'm a really bad developer. I have not done any coding besides perl scripting since VB. Net in grad school about five years ago. Working for our corporate overlords has made my skills rusty.<br /> <br /> My idea was a mySQL database with Web service. Other developers can use the API to pull the charms into thier apps. If someone wants to develop an android app, they already got the charms, spells, martial arts, etc. I got some very rough notes on a database design. I just don't have time! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>mySQL is probably the wrong tool for this - charms are structured data, rather than relational data. SQL is a very powerful and general tool, and it's all many developers know, but there are often easier ways to do things if you look further afield<br /> <br /> I'd probably try couchDB (serve your charms to the internet!) / pouchDB (client side, download your charms from the internet!) myself - it already does tons of what you want. Just choose your data source(s) (the charm &quot;repositories&quot;, publicly accessible couchDB instances), trigger a replication, and bam, you have a local copy of the all the data, merged together into an easily querieable set of JSON documents. Define a couple of &quot;views&quot; (couchDB's equivalent to &quot;saved queries&quot;, sort of) for &quot;Charms of a specific ability&quot; and &quot;Charms I can buy with Ability 3 or less and Essence 2 or less&quot; and away you go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T16:14:39-07:00","id":884141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=884139#post884139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> mySQL is probably the wrong tool for this - charms are structured data, rather than relational data. SQL is a very powerful and general tool, and it's all many developers know, but there are often easier ways to do things if you look further afield<br /> <br /> I'd probably try couchDB (serve your charms to the internet!) / pouchDB (client side, download your charms from the internet!) myself - it already does tons of what you want. Just choose your data source(s) (the charm &quot;repositories&quot;, publicly accessible couchDB instances), trigger a replication, and bam, you have a local copy of the all the data, merged together into an easily querieable set of JSON documents. Define a couple of &quot;views&quot; (couchDB's equivalent to &quot;saved queries&quot;, sort of) for &quot;Charms of a specific ability&quot; and &quot;Charms I can buy with Ability 3 or less and Essence 2 or less&quot; and away you go.</div> </div> </div> </div>A quick Wiki search tells me that this CouchDB is some sort of new fangled NoSQL thing. I'll have to do more research on it later. I use oracle, linux, and perl at work, so I haven't really kept up on the new tech. <br /> <br /> Eh. It's mostly an idea I had that will never come to fruition. I spend all day working with code. Coming home and working with even more code sounds like hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T19:34:39-07:00","id":884261,"title":"","content":"Well in our case, our method actually uses a tool for charm and merit data entry. Which is also going to be bundled into future versions of Anathema Reincarnated as the Chronicle Editor, which means that in the future there's actually going to be quite a bit of support for custom merits and charms. Which I'm told saves into the .json format anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T19:45:34-07:00","id":884271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=884261#post884261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well in our case, our method actually uses a tool for charm and merit data entry. Which is also going to be bundled into future versions of Anathema Reincarnated as the Chronicle Editor, which means that in the future there's actually going to be quite a bit of support for custom merits and charms. Which I'm told saves into the .json format anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm of the opinion that all .json files should live in the Crystal Lake folder. Seriously though, thank you for this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-07T02:39:53-07:00","id":884487,"title":"","content":"Okay so I gave it a whirl.<br /> <br /> First impressions was that it's a LOT to take in all at once. A bit like the EX3 Manual it's a little intimidating from a first look.It actually does quite a lot for running a battle and that's actually really good, but its presented in such a way as to make tracking that information not really different from using a notepad or some such. I don't think the 'apply damage' mechanic is really useful for withering attacks until the utility is tracking dice pools and penalties (as that seems to be what you're working towards).<br /> <br /> I did not encounter any glitches with using it, thought i didn't do much other than add two combatants and run a simple combat. I did notice that there are a lot of edge cases where withering damage works differently due to the attacks and actions taken that made manual control of the initiative tracks more simple than trying to use the inbuilt damage component.<br /> <br /> I'm running an actual game tomorrow, so I'll muck about with it and come back with an appraisal of how easy it is to set up and track a full combat with multiple people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-07T07:46:34-07:00","id":884621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elkovash</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=884487#post884487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay so I gave it a whirl.<br /> <br /> First impressions was that it's a LOT to take in all at once. A bit like the EX3 Manual it's a little intimidating from a first look.It actually does quite a lot for running a battle and that's actually really good, but its presented in such a way as to make tracking that information not really different from using a notepad or some such. I don't think the 'apply damage' mechanic is really useful for withering attacks until the utility is tracking dice pools and penalties (as that seems to be what you're working towards).<br /> <br /> I did not encounter any glitches with using it, thought i didn't do much other than add two combatants and run a simple combat. I did notice that there are a lot of edge cases where withering damage works differently due to the attacks and actions taken that made manual control of the initiative tracks more simple than trying to use the inbuilt damage component.<br /> <br /> I'm running an actual game tomorrow, so I'll muck about with it and come back with an appraisal of how easy it is to set up and track a full combat with multiple people.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, as we've said, this is a teaser more than anything else.<br /> <br /> I recall comparing it to trying to call a bare car frame, body and engine powered by a set of bicycle pedals instead of a gas tank a &quot;car&quot; Functional? Yes. Workable? Yes. Better than what you had before? Yes. As powerful as it should be? Hell no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T10:23:29-07:00","id":885470,"title":"","content":"My take, as a significant contributor to the Anathema project: It's really good to see other initiatives, and I wish you guys luck. I think adopting the Anathema 'brand name' is in poor taste without having received prior authorization from Urs, though. That's not cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/347-mobius","name":"Mobius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T10:56:44-07:00","id":885490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mobius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=885470#post885470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My take, as a significant contributor to the Anathema project: It's really good to see other initiatives, and I wish you guys luck. I think adopting the Anathema 'brand name' is in poor taste without having received prior authorization from Urs, though. That's not cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't realize that Anathema was Urs' brand. Not being snarky, just confused a bit. We're not trying to do anything bad, here. Also, if you have a good way of contacting him I'd appreciate the help. We tried, but he hasn't been around much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T11:01:50-07:00","id":885494,"title":"","content":"Skimming past the thread, I picked up these major points:<br /> a) You are doing something to help people manage their games using Kotlin and JavaFX and are aiming for desktop PCs.<br /> b) You meant to ask me something about it but I never replied. This is due to me never seeing your message.<br /> c) You want to call this beast 'Anathema Reincarnated'.<br /> d) People are eager to help out.<br /> e) You are writing this from scratch.<br /> f) I never integrated your pull request on github.<br /> <br /> Did I miss anything? What can I do for you people?<br /> <br /> For what it's worth, rumors of my burnout are greatly exaggerated. Details don't matter here, but there is no secret to be kept under wraps. Send me a mail or IM if you want to know more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/136-urskr","name":"urskr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T11:29:37-07:00","id":885517,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kenai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=885490#post885490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I didn't realize that Anathema was Urs' brand. Not being snarky, just confused a bit. We're not trying to do anything bad, here. Also, if you have a good way of contacting him I'd appreciate the help. We tried, but he hasn't been around much.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a mail address on anathema.github.io which goes to my inbox, among others. Asking to get in touch over there is much more efficient than IMing me, for usually I am doing my very own interpretation of Cthulhu here.<br /> Having read your message now, it is very respectful and touches upon all the right points. No worries.<br /> <br /> That leaves us with me &quot;blessing&quot; things. I am torn.<br /> On the one hand, you'll have something out much earlier than me. That's good for the community and that is what matters.<br /> On the other hand, I have seen efforts like this before, and I would like to see more of your tool before I lend my name to anything. Skimming your code, you still have a lot of ground to cover.<br /> Ultimately, though, I cannot keep you from calling your program any way you like, for &quot;Anathema&quot; is not my brand. It is an unusual greek word that some people put in a book about fictional superheroes which I picked up on, re-interpreted as an acronym and uppercased before I applied it to a programming project I happened to be involved in at the time.<br /> However, people do associate it with the work that Sandra and myself have done between 2004 and 2012.**<br /> Thus, I would appreciate if you kept on working for a while before appropriating the name.<br /> <br /> <br /> ** Here's to all the people who contributed, took over, gave back and worked with us! Sean, Curt, Martin, Eric, Rob! And to Scott, may he rest in peace! Anathema, represent!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/136-urskr","name":"urskr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T12:13:52-07:00","id":885568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>urskr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=885517#post885517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">THUS SAYITH THE SUN</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel as though god has come and laid down some holy writ.<br /> <br /> In all seriousness, I'm going to be honest with you - the only reason that this is its own project is because I couldn't get a foothold in the existing Anathema code when I tried. I'd love to be able to finish the closest thing to an &quot;official&quot; app the community has, but I didn't understand the project well enough to make it happen. I also didn't consider myself significant enough to ask for the necessary tutelage, so my business partner and I (we are taking a break from our studio's debut game) decided to go it alone.<br /> <br /> That being said, fair enough on wanting to see more of the project. In fact...<br /> <br /> &quot;What can I do for you people?&quot;<br /> <br /> I'll be sending you a message. If Anathema isn't as dead as I thought it to be, then it might get finished soon after all. Whatever it takes the serve the community!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If at first you don't succeed, refactor!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6102-kenai","name":"Kenai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T12:48:07-07:00","id":885605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kenai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=885568#post885568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Veneration, explanation, communication</div> </div> </div> </div>I have been and still am fully willing to help you get going with our code. If I didn't make that clear enough earlier, then it was simply because your pull request gave me the impression that you are more than capable to deal with anything we have built.<br /> That offer goes out to anyone, by the way: I will gladly help with understanding our architecture and design and review your pull requests. I won't teach Java or the basics of OO programming, though. Also, note that I'll be on vacation the next few weeks.<br /> <br /> Kenai, I IMed both of you myself since I did not yet see the message you promised above.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/136-urskr","name":"urskr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T13:39:42-07:00","id":885653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated#post882498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I feel a bit nervous making this announcement, perhaps a bit presumptuous, but, I and a friend of mine (Kenai on these forums) have been working to finish Urskr's work on a version of Anathema for Third Edition Exalted.<br /> <br /> We call it &quot;Anathema Reincarnated&quot; and it is currently well on it's way to its first, official version. Until then, we wanted to get people excited for the finished application, with this;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://bitbucket.org/blakwurm/anathema-reincarnated/downloads\" target=\"_blank\">https://bitbucket.org/blakwurm/anath...ated/downloads</a><br /> <br /> It's a link to our teaser for Anathema; a complete combat tracker! Do you sometimes have difficulty tracking your circle's essence, health, initiative and so on? Then, you can make use of this simple application! All it requires to run is Java 8 or newer. Simply download the file and run; you can currently save combatants, manage stats and healthtracks, and even run most of the combat calculations. It still requires some manual function; battlegroups don't automatically calculate the additional damage from being attacked decisively, for instance, but for the most part you can easily speed up combat with this function of our new app.<br /> <br /> Although we aren't part of the Anathema team, we have the utmost respect for them and Urskr's work, and, given that his version of Anathema has been shelved for the time being, possibly forever, we hope that we can give back to the Exalted community as much as they and the game alike have given back to us.<br /> <br /> More features are on the horizon, so check back regularly. We intend for Anathema Reincarnated to be a useful tool for STs and players alike.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Awesome! Thank you guys! Please lemme know if you need help testing out Anathema Reinc. So stoked <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","name":"TheSly9","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11633_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T18:48:19-07:00","id":885868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>urskr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=885494#post885494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Skimming past the thread, I picked up these major points:<br /> a) You are doing something to help people manage their games using Kotlin and JavaFX and are aiming for desktop PCs.<br /> b) You meant to ask me something about it but I never replied. This is due to me never seeing your message.<br /> c) You want to call this beast 'Anathema Reincarnated'.<br /> d) People are eager to help out.<br /> e) You are writing this from scratch.<br /> f) I never integrated your pull request on github.<br /> <br /> Did I miss anything? What can I do for you people?<br /> <br /> For what it's worth, rumors of my burnout are greatly exaggerated. Details don't matter here, but there is no secret to be kept under wraps. Send me a mail or IM if you want to know more.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> a). We also have ambitions of a mobile version in the future. As I recall when we spoke previously, so do you.<br /> b). I am the one to blame here, lacking in a better method of contact you, as well as your absence and the lack of activity on the official Anathema site, I presumed the only way to reach you was via PM.<br /> c). I also am the one who came up with the name, though Kenai approved it and put it in. And if ou mean beast in the sense that there is a number of features we intend to add, and indeed are close to doing so, then yes.<br /> d). Well to be honest, people are eager to help you too Urs. Honestly that's why we're here too.<br /> e). Correct. It's been moving very fast, actually.<br /> f). correct.<br /> <br /> Basically, if this means that Anathema and it's team are not as dead as we feared then we'd be pleased to join you and hope we can bring some good things to the whole; there's not really any point in splitting the fanbase over this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T03:41:19-07:00","id":886083,"title":"","content":"I'm not actually involved in either project (except being an Anathema user who once found one bug), but yeah, I'd suggest going with another name. I know Anathema is the &quot;iconic&quot; character management tool, but... well, this isn't Anathema, it's a new project that's just meant to do the same thing.<br /> <br /> But then, when I try to come up with alternative names, I end up with &quot;The [Scarlet/Immaculate] Manager&quot;, so...<br /> (Oh, hey, &quot;The Immaculate Manager&quot; ends up as TIM...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Silencing Whisper, <i>Eclipse</i>; Amethyst, <i>Changing Moon</i>;<br /> Daughter of Charcoal and Ash, <i>Dusk</i>, and her <i>Full Moon </i>sister;<br /> Broken Crystal, <i>Infernal </i>(<i>Night</i>-, or maybe <i>Twilight</i>-equivalent).","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7262-amakawa-yuuto","name":"Amakawa Yuuto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7262_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T04:28:44-07:00","id":886100,"title":"","content":"I like TIM.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThe very existence of flame-throwers proves that some time, somewhere, someone said to themselves, You know, I want to set those people over there on fire, but I'm just not close enough to get the job done.\u201d George Carlin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/123-trax","name":"Trax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar123_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T04:33:22-07:00","id":886104,"title":"","content":"What would make it TIMTOM? The Immaculate Manager Trains Other Masters? Silly, but I like TIMTOM as a name. ^_^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T05:02:51-07:00","id":886114,"title":"","content":"Just want to pipe in with the observation that exposing a MySQL database directly to the internet is not the greatest of ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T07:07:18-07:00","id":886190,"title":"","content":"Look folks, to be blunt, even if the name issue needs to be resolved and the two projects aren't combined, we aren't going with TIM.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T07:58:42-07:00","id":886258,"title":"","content":"First off, good job, to both teams, as I use Anathema already (in its current state), and used it back in 2/2.5 E. So I am already a big fan, and I support both projects and appreciate your combined efforts.<br /> <br /> Now if you efforts were truly combined, <i>that would be freaking awesome.</i> <br /> <br /> If its not combined, why not call it &quot;Second Breath&quot;, since that's what the exalted call their moment of exaltation (which is sort of when the character usually gets built)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11632-ramaloke","name":"Ramaloke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T08:58:56-07:00","id":886316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=886190#post886190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Look folks, to be blunt, even if the name issue needs to be resolved and the two projects aren't combined, we aren't going with TIM.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're right.<br /> <br /> Obviously, the correct name is Jack Harper.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T11:14:06-07:00","id":886472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=885868#post885868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> a). We also have ambitions of a mobile version in the future. As I recall when we spoke previously, so do you.<br /> b). I am the one to blame here, lacking in a better method of contact you, as well as your absence and the lack of activity on the official Anathema site, I presumed the only way to reach you was via PM.<br /> c). I also am the one who came up with the name, though Kenai approved it and put it in. And if ou mean beast in the sense that there is a number of features we intend to add, and indeed are close to doing so, then yes.<br /> d). Well to be honest, people are eager to help you too Urs. Honestly that's why we're here too.<br /> e). Correct. It's been moving very fast, actually.<br /> f). correct.<br /> <br /> Basically, if this means that Anathema and it's team are not as dead as we feared then we'd be pleased to join you and hope we can bring some good things to the whole; there's not really any point in splitting the fanbase over this.</div> </div> </div> </div>a) I'd recommend to go mobile right away, then, or pick a hybrid/web framework to build on. Ex3 desparately needs a multi-device mobile combat manager with full Charm support.<br /> d/f) If so, I never learned how to tap into that or made it too hard for people. I can remember few offers of help that actually turned into running code. Me not integrating a contribution due to my ridiculous schedule, as it was with Kenai's, certainly is not the main reason.<br /> <br /> As for joining or splitting, Kenai and I are considering options via e-mail. Should we pull you into that discussion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/136-urskr","user":"urskr","date":".  Missed a paragraph 05-09-2016, 02:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/136-urskr","name":"urskr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T14:58:30-07:00","id":886653,"title":"","content":"Please do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T22:33:41-07:00","id":887898,"title":"","content":"I simply don't know enough to help with the code/programming side. I think some of the others are in the same boat. However, some of us have some skills that may be of some use. UI design. Graphic design. Etc etc. I know that may not be everything you need but maybe we could be put to use working on some of the other (smaller) pieces of the puzzle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","name":"TheSly9","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11633_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T23:42:59-07:00","id":887942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ramaloke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=886258#post886258\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If its not combined, why not call it &quot;Second Breath&quot;, since that's what the exalted call their moment of exaltation (which is sort of when the character usually gets built)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Can I second that? Because that's a really BADASS name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T02:42:40-07:00","id":888004,"title":"","content":"If there's a mortal/Heroic Mortal/Dragon Blood/Wyld Mutant options then Second Breath, whilst cool, wouldn't fit. &quot;Creation&quot; would be all encompassing ... as it covers everything and is what it does to boot. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'd love to help, but my technical days are behind me, I had some Java/C++ and bits but I've literally not coded for 15 years now. I'd need to relearn it all again and the technical stuff you've mentioned are, to me, pretty much Old Realm and I am a lowly unenlightened mortal.<br /> <br /> I can proof read like a beatch though. I sometimes draw stickmen. I've been known to demolish truly colossal amounts of food. If none of that is useful I'll just offer my support in terms of cheering you all on. A useful tool would be great be that two separate ones of one big group effort. The fanbase will appreciate it and I'd likely be able to spread some awareness if nothing else as most of the players around my way simply don't think to check anything RPG-related online. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Good luck guys - there's a fair few of us I suspect lurking and watching in anticipation!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/907-jay","name":"Jay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T11:33:35-07:00","id":888403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheSly9</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=887898#post887898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I simply don't know enough to help with the code/programming side. I think some of the others are in the same boat. However, some of us have some skills that may be of some use. UI design. Graphic design. Etc etc. I know that may not be everything you need but maybe we could be put to use working on some of the other (smaller) pieces of the puzzle.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, funnily enough, UI design is Kenai and my bag already, and where we started before Kenai decided he was looking at the thing bass ackwards. It was a shame too, we had a really pretty design going. Oh well, maybe for a mobile release.<br /> <br /> As for calling it Second Breath, while I agree that it is indeed a badass name, well... there's some things being discussed. We might not have to change the name after all. But that's all I will say for now.<br /> <br /> I will say though, assuming a mobile version comes out, we were considering calling it &quot;Mote&quot; but, Second Breath is also a good idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T11:38:12-07:00","id":888409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>urskr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=886472#post886472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">a) I'd recommend to go mobile right away, then, or pick a hybrid/web framework to build on. Ex3 desparately needs a multi-device mobile combat manager with full Charm support.</div> </div> </div> </div>I couldn't agree more with this vote.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jay</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=888004#post888004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there's a mortal/Heroic Mortal/Dragon Blood/Wyld Mutant options then Second Breath, whilst cool, wouldn't fit. </div> </div> </div> </div><i>Technically</i> speaking, allowing Dragon-Blooded means Anathema never fit. So that logic doesn't really hold, IMO. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T11:44:24-07:00","id":888415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jay</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=888004#post888004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there's a mortal/Heroic Mortal/Dragon Blood/Wyld Mutant options then Second Breath, whilst cool, wouldn't fit. &quot;Creation&quot; would be all encompassing ... as it covers everything and is what it does to boot. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>The original Anathema had Terrestrials so... the name doesn't have to be perfect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T14:34:28-07:00","id":888563,"title":"","content":"As far as I know the Dragonblooded call their moment of Exaltation &quot;The Second Breath&quot; too (exaltation happens to all exalts, but obviously mortals/heroic-mortals/raksha aren't exalts, but mortals and heroic mortals definitely aren't Anathema and it was fine). Either way, I just thought the name was cool so I figured I'd suggest it.<br /> <br /> Mote for a moble app sounds like a cool name too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11632-ramaloke","name":"Ramaloke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T19:34:15-07:00","id":888772,"title":"","content":"I second Second Breath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T02:04:00-07:00","id":888965,"title":"","content":"Confession - I never used Anathema. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Didn't even know it existed until the 3rd Ed KS reward. As such I was utterly unaware of what was in it or what it could do. Was it a character creation thing or a campaign management tool too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/907-jay","name":"Jay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T07:20:37-07:00","id":889090,"title":"","content":"I've always been a fan of Anathema, remember building it using Eclipse in the early days. I would love to help you guys out but, sadly, I'm pretty firmly a C++ code monkey these days, so my Java is a tad rusty. Though if you want to port over to the Qt framework, I'd totally be up for that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/738-binary-phantom","name":"Binary Phantom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar738_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T16:11:51-07:00","id":890220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jay</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=888965#post888965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Confession - I never used Anathema. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Didn't even know it existed until the 3rd Ed KS reward. As such I was utterly unaware of what was in it or what it could do. Was it a character creation thing or a campaign management tool too?</div> </div> </div> </div>The original was primarily a character manager and creator, though it did have some support for campaign management. Our tool is targeted both at STs and players, but will provide a number of useful little tools, a few of which won't even be harder to code than me putting stuff in an excel sheet and sending it to Kenai.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T01:56:05-07:00","id":890505,"title":"","content":"This is awesome, but is there an app version somewhere? Having a smartphone or tablet around in a gaming session is far more feasible to me than a whole desktop computer that runs Java.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T07:37:36-07:00","id":890558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=890505#post890505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is awesome, but is there an app version somewhere? Having a smartphone or tablet around in a gaming session is far more feasible to me than a whole desktop computer that runs Java.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know exactly where you are coming from, but a small laptop might fit your needs. Having multiple windows open at once is nice as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-18T10:50:28-07:00","id":893433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=890505#post890505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is awesome, but is there an app version somewhere? Having a smartphone or tablet around in a gaming session is far more feasible to me than a whole desktop computer that runs Java.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not as of yet; keep an eye on this thread.<br /> <br /> I do understand the concern though, I've often had the same issue myself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T22:06:32-07:00","id":895293,"title":"","content":"Second Breath and Mote are both great names. *thumbs up*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T13:21:23-07:00","id":921117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=890220#post890220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The original was primarily a character manager and creator, though it did have some support for campaign management. Our tool is targeted both at STs and players, but will provide a number of useful little tools, a few of which won't even be harder to code than me putting stuff in an excel sheet and sending it to Kenai.</div> </div> </div> </div>there was another toolkit designed for exalted 2e named EdExalted, and admittedly the one i prefered in terms of database management (but i enjoyed anathema's simpler sheets), while im unsure if hes still wanting to do anything related to exalted, itd be interesting to see all of you guys working together on it together, maybe give him a poke?<br /> <br /> heres his webpage: <a href=\"http://www.edexalted.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.edexalted.com/</a> it appears the last time hes touched it was in february 2016, so there may be some hopes there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1364-nemo_oceansoul","name":"Nemo_Oceansoul","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T01:09:47-07:00","id":956198,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the long wait folks; just back on the forums for the first time in a long while, since I had to reorganize my life after getting a new job.<br /> <br /> But you're not here for my personal gossip, so I figured I'd give you all an update on what's going on with Anathema Reincarnated. My buddy Kenai didn't want to make a comment about it until it was done, and to be honest, he said that a couple of weeks ago when we thought we were just about to release it, so I think you all are overdue.<br /> <br /> It's currently very near to release now, he's just creating a character creation wizard, then we intend to release it to the fanbase so they can help us with charm entering (yes, we have a system based on keywords and effects for entering custom charms) and has mostly been delayed by difficulties determining what programming language to use (Specifically Clojure or Kotlin. Don't ask me for technical details. I couldn't begin to tell you if I tried.) <br /> <br /> Other than that, we intend on releasing soon; it's basically going to be his resume for a job with a technical company so he wants to get it out ASAP as well, and Urskr is actually vetting our code and design. Basically it just amounts to he and I having gotten some new jobs lately so it's not been something we've been able to devote all of our time to, but as soon as the wizard is done we can release version 1.0 and start working on features for updates!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T01:37:35-07:00","id":956206,"title":"","content":"... I'd almost forgotten about this project. Wow, it almost seems unreal...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T03:19:36-07:00","id":956238,"title":"","content":"That's great news! Thanks for picking up the project and looking forward to trying it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T08:06:25-07:00","id":956319,"title":"","content":"Bit late to the party, but still not a big fan of the name choice. That also said, look forward to seeing the final result.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T08:19:09-07:00","id":956328,"title":"","content":"I'm not feeling too badly about the name personally, Urskr is busy, but when he can, he can release Anathema (Ex3) . Nobody is taking the original name from him, and its not as if he trademarked it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T09:14:45-07:00","id":956366,"title":"","content":"Youre misunderstanding us. Urs currently has no plans to release EX3 Anathema; he intends to do so at some point in that far off country known as &quot;sometime&quot;. But his current interest is in Shadowrun, and he doesnt have enough people to hack it together solo using his coding style. If our project is good enough he may hand off the torch entirely; his blessing is contingent upon the quality of our product so we intend to deliver something truly excellent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 08-23-2016, 12:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T00:01:45-07:00","id":957442,"title":"","content":"I'm personally very excited for this, as I've been making use of the combat tracker in my game since I discovered it. Can't wait to see it all together! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12327-morpheousxo","name":"MorpheousXO","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T12:17:33-07:00","id":961159,"title":"","content":"Say, have you guys considered pitching this to Paradox Interactive? They're a computer game company, so they might not have considered that this sort of program might be a viable supplement, and they are the ones who'd be able to give the go-ahead on the inclusion of copyrighted rules text.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />If you want to play Thomas Edison, you'd better be up to the task of carrying all of civilization through the Renaissance and Industrial Revolution, <i>while the Sidereals and Dragon-Blooded are shooting at you</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/591-jorlem","name":"Jorlem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar591_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T13:15:12-07:00","id":961193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=956198#post956198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's currently very near to release now, he's just creating a character creation wizard, then we intend to release it to the fanbase so they can help us with charm entering (yes, we have a system based on keywords and effects for entering custom charms) and has mostly been delayed by difficulties determining what programming language to use (Specifically Clojure or Kotlin. Don't ask me for technical details. I couldn't begin to tell you if I tried.)</div> </div> </div> </div>If you were to write it in clojure then you could write the backend on the JVM and the front end in cljs running on node.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12096-uncletaco","name":"uncletaco","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T17:02:43-07:00","id":961295,"title":"","content":"I am EAGERLY awaiting a character creator.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12357-marcob","name":"Marcob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T17:15:09-07:00","id":961299,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2442_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2442\" data-vbnamecard=\"2442\">Arian Dynas</a> <br /> <br /> I would like to add my voice to the choir of appreciation you guys should be hearing for this!<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T23:50:00-07:00","id":961480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=956366#post956366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Youre misunderstanding us. Urs currently has no plans to release EX3 Anathema; he intends to do so at some point in that far off country known as &amp;quot;sometime&amp;quot;. But his current interest is in Shadowrun, and he doesnt have enough people to hack it together solo using his coding style. If our project is good enough he may hand off the torch entirely; his blessing is contingent upon the quality of our product so we intend to deliver something truly excellent.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope you dont feel as if you NEED anyone's blessing, because at the end of the day you are the only group who are even close to releasing a EX3 manager as far as I know. That makes you the Gods in my eyes, nobody else gets to be the &quot;gatekeeper&quot; if you are the only ones actually treading this ground.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T17:31:20-07:00","id":964660,"title":"","content":"Well. I'm in serious need of an Exalted manager, so much so that I've forked Urs' code on Github, to see if I can make something usable of it. In doing my due research, I see you're going to release your manager soon, which is good. It sounds like your code will be available as well; also good. I'll likely fork your repository once you release.<br /> <br /> I must observe your project is most ambitious; not merely a character manager, but also covering most of what I've laid out as the features without which I won't be satisfied. I have noted here: characters, merits, and Charms, you've specifically said the user can enter, and Negai referred to working on Sorcery and Martial Arts, presumably with similar functionality to the user; and you'll have a character creation wizard. I would add races, Exaltation types, character generation templates, Thaumaturgic rituals, and items (especially weapons and armor)... but with the impression you give, I'd guess you already have those.<br /> <br /> That alone would make an excellent tool for the Exalted community. The chronicle editor is also something I've thought about- or at least, I've thought of something that could be described with that term. Arian described the Chronicle Editor as where the user enters homebrew Charms and merits, and my idea is something else entirely. Call it what you will, here is what I have in mind: a log of game events and their effects on the characters. For instance, if someone's mortal Retainer is badly injured (all the way to -4, all lethal) on RY 768, Ascending Earth 7, the calendar would show that, if he rested, he would recover on Descending Earth 3- without your need to consult the book like I just did. This would also keep track of experience: when and how you earned it, and on what you spent it- very important if you have someone heavily into the Craft system. Perhaps it would go so far as to track Willpower- Essence pools would be a little too far, I think, but it might be useful under certain circumstances.<br /> <br /> Part of that is my desire not to follow the characters later: starting by looking at their stats at character generation, then watching how the story affected them- and how they adapted to affect the story.<br /> <br /> Finally there's your combat tracker. You've only described your intentions with it as polishing a few shortcomings out, but it strikes me as something that could be extended into a more robust combat simulator. Incorporating such things as combat movement and environmental hazards might take too much effort, but pulling units into a combat state and supporting &quot;{Glorious Jeff} attacks {Nightshade} with {Hammer} vs. Parry with {Dagger} - 12 attack dice (9, +4 Excellency, -1 wound penalty) vs. 1 Defense (4, -2 would penalty, -1 Overwhelming penalty)&quot; and similar actions would be an interesting and useful project.<br /> <br /> Well, enough geeking out. I'm going to go figure out Urs' code. I look forward to seeing yours after the release... and learning a bit of Kotlin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12396-bjblack","name":"bjblack","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T03:27:27-07:00","id":964876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bjblack</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=964660#post964660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well. I'm in serious need of an Exalted manager, so much so that I've forked Urs' code on Github, to see if I can make something usable of it. In doing my due research, I see you're going to release your manager soon, which is good. It sounds like your code will be available as well; also good. I'll likely fork your repository once you release.</div> </div> </div> </div>My solution for this stuff, which is far more lightweight (although lacking a core feature) is to just make a spreadsheet that calculates bp from dot allocations (and a separate column for post-gen points with xp costs). Then I just type the charms in manually (and have a simple formula count them for the xp cost (I tag them by ability so I can tell favored / unfavored)).<br /> <br /> The main thing is this doesn't give you a nice graphical charm picker. The benefit is it's <i>really really easy</i> and you can just refer to one of the fan-made charm trees.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T13:00:07-07:00","id":988987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=956198#post956198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the long wait folks; just back on the forums for the first time in a long while, since I had to reorganize my life after getting a new job.<br /> <br /> But you're not here for my personal gossip, so I figured I'd give you all an update on what's going on with Anathema Reincarnated. My buddy Kenai didn't want to make a comment about it until it was done, and to be honest, he said that a couple of weeks ago when we thought we were just about to release it, so I think you all are overdue.<br /> <br /> It's currently very near to release now, he's just creating a character creation wizard, then we intend to release it to the fanbase so they can help us with charm entering (yes, we have a system based on keywords and effects for entering custom charms) and has mostly been delayed by difficulties determining what programming language to use (Specifically Clojure or Kotlin. Don't ask me for technical details. I couldn't begin to tell you if I tried.)<br /> <br /> Other than that, we intend on releasing soon; it's basically going to be his resume for a job with a technical company so he wants to get it out ASAP as well, and Urskr is actually vetting our code and design. Basically it just amounts to he and I having gotten some new jobs lately so it's not been something we've been able to devote all of our time to, but as soon as the wizard is done we can release version 1.0 and start working on features for updates!</div> </div> </div> </div>Haven't seen any updates since this one... Any news?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12526-tiberius","name":"Tiberius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T04:49:17-08:00","id":1002185,"title":"","content":"Well I can tell you; it's down now to the wire. Basically there's weapons left to do, put together the default Chronicle file, make extra special babby sure that the system identifies legal characters like it's supposed to, implement saving, then we'll be ready to release version 1.0 for you remarkably patient folks. After that we'll start working on the stuff for 1.1, since we intend to clean up some of the things we're leaving a bit intentionally unfinished so as to get a functional version out to the community ASAP, as well as implement some features we're excited about.<br /> <br /> What I can tell you *is* done however, is charms, merits, attributes, abilities, UI design, the combat tracker and a couple other smaller things. Charms really were the biggest bugbear to deal with. Thankfully that's now largely out of the way. so it's downhill from here. We hope to have it ready before year's end, if we can, and we're currently on track to do so, assuming Real Life doesn't intrude again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 11-12-2016, 07:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T13:34:55-08:00","id":1002335,"title":"","content":"Thank you Arian, it is a great service you all are doing us!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T15:46:12-08:00","id":1002383,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2442_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2442\" data-vbnamecard=\"2442\">Arian Dynas</a> Wow, seriously? That's flipping awesome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T16:31:30-08:00","id":1002397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TGUEIROS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1002335#post1002335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you Arian, it is a great service you all are doing us!</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, hey, don't thank me; I'm just the design and support guy. Yeah I helped him understand how the architecture should look, but Kenai designed the UI and did all the programming; without him there is no Anathema.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-13T02:37:02-08:00","id":1002481,"title":"","content":"Thanks Kenai! You are awesome! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T17:31:42-08:00","id":1003701,"title":"","content":"Gah! I can't wait for this to come out! I use the currently released combat tracker every time we have a combat, and I can't wait to have access to a better version of it! Thanks so much for making this!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12327-morpheousxo","name":"MorpheousXO","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T01:54:39-08:00","id":1003824,"title":"","content":"im awaiting the completion of this project with baited breath, i may have a group of people who may like to try exalted, i figure something like this should speed up the process of character generation and such =). good work so far im happy to see this project moving forward =)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1364-nemo_oceansoul","name":"Nemo_Oceansoul","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T15:58:11-08:00","id":1006445,"title":"","content":"Welp, another update of good news; Kenai says he might have it finished ahead of schedule, we're to the point where we're ready to do what we're calling an open beta; validation for PCgen is almost entirely done (we had to scrap the Wizard idea) and right now he's hooking the UI into the functions it does. That's going along swimmingly. I'm going to give it its first QA testing, then if it's solid enough, release to the public to make sure that you guys get something before year's end, and to make sure that we produce something rock solid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T00:58:31-08:00","id":1007089,"title":"","content":"Christmas coming early this year then? \\^_^/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1364-nemo_oceansoul","name":"Nemo_Oceansoul","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T01:08:15-08:00","id":1007091,"title":"","content":"Not gonna lie, my reaction to that was a very undignified squeeing sound!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T06:09:58-08:00","id":1016082,"title":"","content":"I just wanted to ask: is there any chance we could get a <i>rough</i> estimate on when this project will be available to the public?<br /> I totally understand if you don't want to say, but I have a group of newer players that could really use a character builder.<br /> We're trying to figure when we'd start our new campaign, and I'd like to know if there's a chance this would be out before then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-27T20:04:56-08:00","id":1023087,"title":"","content":"Bump for update! How goes it on the project? Hope you hard workers had a happy holiday season!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","name":"TheSly9","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11633_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T16:25:48-08:00","id":1027346,"title":"","content":"just looking to see if any new info is out about this platform. Not trying to rush just hoping you all are good and that this baby is still chugging along","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8897-joshopotamus","name":"joshopotamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T21:12:32-08:00","id":1033135,"title":"","content":"Well, I have good news and bad news. Good news! I understand Exalted Devs more than ever before! Bad news! I understand releasing EX3 more than ever before!<br /> <br /> So, it seems the Christmas release was optimistic, largely because of a hiccough concerning JavaFX, (our programmer had a moment; &quot;This is horrible and doesn't constrain to logic! I'll use another program!<br /> (&quot;Augh! This is even less logical and more horrible! I'll try another! This is just as bad! Screw it, I'll go back to the original because at least that worked, even if it was horrible and illogical&quot;)<br /> <br /> So, considering that most of you don't care a whit about that, I've got this!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/n7N9FmC.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Enjoy your sneak preview of our UI. Don't mind the mac stylings. Knai just had to replace his PC with a MAC he got cheap, so... it'll still work on PC though. Works fine on mine.And now it'll work on MAC too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 01-17-2017, 02:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T00:38:35-08:00","id":1033204,"title":"","content":"That looks awesome! Glad to hear this project is still continuing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T00:50:05-08:00","id":1033210,"title":"","content":"We aim to please the eye.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T01:37:14-08:00","id":1033227,"title":"","content":"This sounds like an elaborate Sidereal ploy because one was a mac user the whole time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T07:08:13-08:00","id":1033337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1033227#post1033227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This sounds like an elaborate Sidereal ploy because one was a mac user the whole time.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Of course not.<br /> <br /> And you never asked that question.<br /> <br /> /waves his hand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T10:25:15-08:00","id":1033437,"title":"","content":"This looks spectacular! I'm super impressed visually!<br /> <br /> This is probably too detailed to get into at this point, but if you're willing to answer, does Anathema support unusual setups like The Burning Name, where a merit creates a unique attack based on an Occult die pool?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T10:27:15-08:00","id":1033441,"title":"","content":"Oh hey, great to hear from you again. And no worries about the delay, take the time you need. The only delay I wager most of us won't be alright with is &quot;Yeah, we're dropping the project, it's cursed&quot;. That'd make me sad (but not angry) at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T17:38:04-08:00","id":1033762,"title":"","content":"Been looking forward to seeing this released ever since it was announced and the teaser image has me pretty hyped! You mentioned that the Christmas release was optimistic, is there any chance you could make another release assessment? I know what it's like to expect to be done a programming project and then get caught up on the weirdest things. You know what they say, &quot;he first 90 percent of the code accounts for the first 90 percent of the development time. The remaining 10 percent of the code accounts for the other 90 percent of the development time.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T19:18:38-08:00","id":1033820,"title":"","content":"Seeing the teaser image is like looking at Richt's updates about the Deluxe Edition Core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-18T07:28:08-08:00","id":1033995,"title":"","content":"Keep up the good work! Me and my players cheer your efforts!!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-18T07:34:12-08:00","id":1034001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1033437#post1033437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This looks spectacular! I'm super impressed visually!<br /> <br /> This is probably too detailed to get into at this point, but if you're willing to answer, does Anathema support unusual setups like The Burning Name, where a merit creates a unique attack based on an Occult die pool?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, as things stand currently... that's a difficult question to answer, actually. I mean for instance we're going to try and have support and combat tracker interhook between PC charms and... basically everything. (As I am sure you can imagine, yes, beta testing will be invaluable, thanks in advance guys.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nilihum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1033762#post1033762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Been looking forward to seeing this released ever since it was announced and the teaser image has me pretty hyped! You mentioned that the Christmas release was optimistic, is there any chance you could make another release assessment? I know what it's like to expect to be done a programming project and then get caught up on the weirdest things. You know what they say, &quot;he first 90 percent of the code accounts for the first 90 percent of the development time. The remaining 10 percent of the code accounts for the other 90 percent of the development time.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>You have no idea how right you are about that. As far as ETA to open beta... well it's basically on a wait and see kind of point right now, but thankfully should be something functional by the time Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wilds comes out.<br /> <br /> What? You mean you don't mark your calendar by such things?<br /> <br /> Fine, fine, probably sometime mid Feburary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T18:10:44-08:00","id":1034975,"title":"","content":"I'd be happy to help Beta it for you. I got a few other STs I know who are keen as well. Maybe we can setup a gdoc or something similar to share bugs/finds?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","name":"TheSly9","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11633_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T22:32:41-08:00","id":1035080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheSly9</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1034975#post1034975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be happy to help Beta it for you. I got a few other STs I know who are keen as well. Maybe we can setup a gdoc or something similar to share bugs/finds?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually part of the idea is it's going to be an open beta, with a location to report bugs. We don't expect very many, but we know it'll take some work to get kinks out.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T05:54:21-08:00","id":1035182,"title":"","content":"I'm very much looking forward to the open beta. I've currently got a spreadsheet that my table uses for character generation but it doesn't lay everything out in a nice character sheet for them. It's super helpful for the character generating for new people but not as much for playing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1g_IC644YJoiVAm6ngqcBmsQtff2YYtd3pDbZpaOxx4o\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Character Creation Tool may be downloaded here.</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1086797-demac-s-exalted-character-creation-tool\" target=\"_blank\">The thread talking about the tool can be found here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1136654-exalted-seats-of-power\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted: Seats of Power is a homebrewed manse creation system.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1oaq3wk7lJKZ022SUA4iPfGzMpmBTNXlM\" target=\"_blank\">I have a rewrite of the craft system which can be downloaded here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1070312-i-got-my-book-it-s-super-fancy-and-i-can-t-read-the-cover/page2\" target=\"_blank\">I like the Mesoamerican look</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2346-demac","name":"Demac","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"385"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T13:44:00-07:00","id":1061601,"title":"","content":"Is this project dead? Given that there haven't been any commits to the repo since December, I'm kinda assuming so, but hoping not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13112-kenlon","name":"kenlon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T21:37:15-07:00","id":1061725,"title":"","content":"Hmm, yeah, originally something was slated for February, maybe the schedule has slipped somewhat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T21:57:06-07:00","id":1061728,"title":"","content":"Delays are not unexpected for hobby projects. I'm still optimistic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T23:02:26-07:00","id":1061732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ninety-ninety_rule\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/static/images/icons/enwiki-25.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ninety-ninety_rule\" target=\"_blank\"> Ninety&ndash;ninety rule - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ninety-ninety_rule\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ninety-ninety_rule </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's really hard to estimate when a program will be done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11315-remulader","name":"Remulader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11315_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T12:40:39-07:00","id":1061922,"title":"","content":"Well, Arian was measuring time by Zelda release, so maybe we've just lost the devs to the depths of BoTW, and will just need to wait for them to slay Gannondorf before returning to us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1982-spacepup","name":"Spacepup","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T20:31:13-07:00","id":1062151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacepup</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1061922#post1061922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, Arian was measuring time by Zelda release, so maybe we've just lost the devs to the depths of BoTW, and will just need to wait for them to slay Gannondorf before returning to us.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Calamity Gannon&quot; this time. But probably yes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T09:15:00-07:00","id":1070687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kenlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1061601#post1061601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is this project dead? Given that there haven't been any commits to the repo since December, I'm kinda assuming so, but hoping not.</div> </div> </div> </div>The reports of our death have been greatly exaggerated!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1062151#post1062151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Calamity Gannon&quot; this time. But probably yes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Achem. Ganon. With one n. In the Zelda fandom, spelling it with two is a keel-haulable offense.<br /> <br /> Anyway, in part the real reason for our abscence... was largely our programmer taking a break so as to not burn out, since Anathema has been frustratingly elusive as of late. No worries though, it's still getting made even if it requires motivation with a whip and a chair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T10:12:51-07:00","id":1070719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1070687#post1070687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No worries though, it's still getting made even if it requires motivation with a whip and a chair.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good! Any HR person worth their salt operates with this principle...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YdXQJS3Yv0Y\" data-code=\"YdXQJS3Yv0Y\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/YdXQJS3Yv0Y/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4567,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","user":"Volivat","date":". 03-30-2017, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T18:52:28-07:00","id":1070977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1070687#post1070687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The reports of our death have been greatly exaggerated!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Achem. Ganon. With one n. In the Zelda fandom, spelling it with two is a keel-haulable offense.<br /> <br /> Anyway, in part the real reason for our abscence... was largely our programmer taking a break so as to not burn out, since Anathema has been frustratingly elusive as of late. No worries though, it's still getting made even if it requires motivation with a whip and a chair.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good to know that you're you're still around. Just finished working on my 4th year programming project, so I know all about burning out. You haven't updated the repositories in a while though, is there any chance of an update there? I would like to go through the code if I ever got the chance. Is the program going to be available for mobile devices, by the way? It'd be handy just to have in your pocket.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T21:23:25-07:00","id":1071026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nilihum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1070977#post1070977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Good to know that you're you're still around. Just finished working on my 4th year programming project, so I know all about burning out. You haven't updated the repositories in a while though, is there any chance of an update there? I would like to go through the code if I ever got the chance. Is the program going to be available for mobile devices, by the way? It'd be handy just to have in your pocket.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, I'll ask Kenai about updating the Github. I *do* know he's been wanting to keep most of it under his hat for the time being. Something about not wanting to release it until it's good enough. If nothing else, we're always willing to welcome collaborators, it gets things done quicker, so I can put you into contact with him if you're interested.<br /> <br /> As for mobile devices... not yet. If ya read back further in this thread you'll see some comments about us preparing a mobile version as well called &quot;Mote&quot; that will be basically a partial adaptation of some features of the full Anathema Reincarnated desktop edition. It won't have the .Chron editor, for instance.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T00:11:06-07:00","id":1071104,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1071026#post1071026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Well, I'll ask Kenai about updating the Github. I *do* know he's been wanting to keep most of it under his hat for the time being. Something about not wanting to release it until it's good enough. If nothing else, we're always willing to welcome collaborators, it gets things done quicker, so I can put you into contact with him if you're interested.<br /> <br /> As for mobile devices... not yet. If ya read back further in this thread you'll see some comments about us preparing a mobile version as well called &quot;Mote&quot; that will be basically a partial adaptation of some features of the full Anathema Reincarnated desktop edition. It won't have the .Chron editor, for instance.</div> </div> </div> </div>People aren't going to want to hear this, but keeping a project locked until it's really ready is a smart idea. You only get to make 1st impression, so make it a good one. After that first stable build, where people can really measure it's value fairly, is when to open it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11315-remulader","name":"Remulader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11315_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T00:28:34-07:00","id":1071110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Remulader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1071104#post1071104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> People aren't going to want to hear this, but keeping a project locked until it's really ready is a smart idea. You only get to make 1st impression, so make it a good one. After that first stable build, where people can really measure it's value fairly, is when to open it up.</div> </div> </div> </div>Halelujah, someone who understands us! I mean, if I had my way I'd be giving you guys more little tidbits at least, but, well we both know why the Devs didn't release EX3 until it was truly ready.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1070719#post1070719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Good! Any HR person worth their salt operates with this principle...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YdXQJS3Yv0Y\" data-code=\"YdXQJS3Yv0Y\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/YdXQJS3Yv0Y/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Fun fact, that was my favorite song in that movie, and I was disappointed it wasn't used as a marching song in the Pete Jackson version because, last I checked, Tolkien wrote it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T05:49:13-07:00","id":1071202,"title":"","content":"Sam's Troll rhyme will always be my favorite Tolkien song, though Down to Goblin Town and the whip marching song are always close seconds.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vbkosl8nq_g\" data-code=\"vbkosl8nq_g\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/vbkosl8nq_g/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> I always liked it because it feels like it or something like it could easily be slipped in as a jaunty tune about tricksters and monsters in any game setting.<br /> <br /> Also it's got Rob Inglis singing about bones and boners, so that's funny too.<br /> <br /> On topic however, once you guys have a release, how is modifications and customization going to be handled? 2e anathema was easy to use, but as someone who doesn't really code I felt like it was pretty well locked down. I always preferred Anathema but I liked how some other options like Ed's Exalted Toolkit had options where you could tweak all the chargen values or add templates using the chargen software itself. It was super helpful to someone like me, because I played primarily in a MUSH that used custom chargen values, so I could just make a template for each splat and use that whenever I wanted to make a new character.<br /> <br /> I know that kind of built-in customization is too much to ask for in a new release, but being able to tweak new character BP or being able to change the number of starting favored abilities and other things like that inside the utility instead of editing files would be nice down the road.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1982,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1982-spacepup","user":"Spacepup","date":". 03-31-2017, 09:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1982-spacepup","name":"Spacepup","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T06:18:29-07:00","id":1071214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacepup</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1071202#post1071202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sam's Troll rhyme will always be my favorite Tolkien song, though Down to Goblin Town and the whip marching song are always close seconds.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vbkosl8nq_g\" data-code=\"vbkosl8nq_g\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/vbkosl8nq_g/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> I always liked it because it feels like it or something like it could easily be slipped in as a jaunty tune about tricksters and monsters in any game setting.<br /> <br /> Also it's got Rob Inglis singing about bones and boners, so that's funny too.<br /> <br /> On topic however, once you guys have a release, how is modifications and customization going to be handled? 2e anathema was easy to use, but as someone who doesn't really code I felt like it was pretty well locked down. I always preferred Anathema but I liked how some other options like Ed's Exalted Toolkit had options where you could tweak all the chargen values or add templates using the chargen software itself. It was super helpful to someone like me, because I played primarily in a MUSH that used custom chargen values, so I could just make a template for each splat and use that whenever I wanted to make a new character.<br /> <br /> I know that kind of built-in customization is too much to ask for in a new release, but being able to tweak new character BP or being able to change the number of starting favored abilities and other things like that inside the utility instead of editing files would be nice down the road.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Basically, you ever programmed your own macros for an MMORPG? It'll be like that.<br /> <br /> Considering Kenai is of the opinion that everyone should learn to code and I'm... not. We split the difference, so basically adding in your own custom content in terms of charms and powers and such will actually be fairly simple and be things like <br /> <br /> [Charm] Archery<br /> <br /> [remove] 2 [intitative]<br /> <br /> [add] 5 [initiative damage] to [target]<br /> <br /> We'll write a how to tutorial for people who want to add custom charms and such.<br /> <br /> We also plan on supporting it with other splats as they come out. Other than that, pc gen will actually be pretty firmly controlled, but if you want to edit something *post* PC gen you just can say whatever like &quot;Add 50 EXP&quot; since we *are* mostly looking to support the base-rules, while leaving space open for some customization. Sorry in advance to some people if you don't care for that, but there'll be some space to implement your houserules if you want to jigger the system around after you've finalized a generated PC, or, even if you feel like going in and re-writing some code on your own (assuming you've the chops) to implement them yourself. Kenai's made very sure that the code is the best, cleanest he can make it, even if he kind of follows his own rules with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T17:26:21-07:00","id":1071515,"title":"","content":"If it's not too hard, it would be awesome if it would at least let you &quot;finalize&quot; a character without spending everything - both to represent weaker characters, and because I use a custom, XP-based ruleset for character creation that can result in characters having, i.e., less than 15 Charms or less than 10 dots of Merits.<br /> <br /> Glad to hear this project is still around, in any case. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Murcushio: Sure, you avoid all that messy withdrawal, but you still need to <i>stop doing heroin</i> (for the purposes of this discussion your cousin is named Heroin).","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4657-maxastro","name":"MaxAstro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T17:23:34-07:00","id":1083233,"title":"","content":"So got some news;<br /> <br /> Basically, we have a finished, workable beta version of Anathema!<br /> <br /> That's the good news.<br /> <br /> The bad news is that Intellij has suddenly decided it doesn't like playing nice anymore and has thrown all of its toys out of the pram.<br /> <br /> So to keep you all in the loop, this basically means that we're going to have to go through and copy-paste the code from the project into another compiler, which means that we've gotten some delays. Luckily Kenai's going to have a month or so of free evenings come up soon which will hopefully give him time to basically brute force the project back into functionality.<br /> <br /> Figured I'd let you all know, since you know, you've not gotten some info in a good while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T21:47:27-07:00","id":1083337,"title":"","content":"Thanks for this update, Arian. I say that this is pretty dang good news overall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T00:28:28-07:00","id":1083374,"title":"","content":"Honestly at this point, Kenai's about to bite the bullet, and his principles and start to learn EMACS to compile it if he must.<br /> <br /> He's uh... not in favor of this plan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T04:18:51-07:00","id":1083402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1083374#post1083374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly at this point, Kenai's about to bite the bullet, and his principles and start to learn EMACS to compile it if he must.<br /> <br /> He's uh... not in favor of this plan.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like I said, the last 10% of the code accounts for the other 90% of the development. Best of luck, lads. And just make it in Java next time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T11:58:54-07:00","id":1083596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nilihum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1083402#post1083402\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Like I said, the last 10% of the code accounts for the other 90% of the development. Best of luck, lads. And just make it in Java next time.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Making it in Java would have taken this long just to make the most basic code.<br /> <br /> Trust me, we had very good reasons NOT to do it in Java. Java alone is responsible for a third of the wait until we scrapped using it entirely.<br /> <br /> What was a big issue about a month or so back was that Kenai was using his favorite programming language Clojure. Before he'd flip-flopped between Kotlin and Clojure. The difference being that Clojure gave him more freedom and was more flexible, but that Kotlin was effort-saving. He eventually went with Clojure after I'd reminded him that if Kotlin was still taking more time and effort to bang into a finished product, it wasn't really saving effort.<br /> <br /> Then the problem was one of having to do it all over again in Kotlin as he saw, because Clojurescript doesn't support Android in it's most recent incarnation, and because if he was going to *make* an Android version of Anathema, he'd have to do it in a way that was &quot;messy&quot; for future programmers.<br /> <br /> At this point, I pointed out to him one important thing he'd not been thinking about; yes, we want to make solid, good script that might last for 10 years, much in the same way the Exalted Devs did. But at the same time, if someone is going to learn how to code to support Anathema after we're unable to (A time I don't see coming for quite a while) they're going to learn how to code because they love Exalted, not because they already know how to code in Kotlin and they like Exalted, but god, learning a new scripting language to support an existent app is just like, so hard man!<br /> <br /> So that's where we were.... right up until IntelliJ decided it didn't like the Clojure 1.7 code anymore and puked it up all over his desktop.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 04-25-2017, 03:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T13:25:45-07:00","id":1083642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1083596#post1083596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Making it in Java would have taken this long just to make the most basic code.<br /> <br /> Trust me, we had very good reasons NOT to do it in Java. Java alone is responsible for a third of the wait until we scrapped using it entirely.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know, that's why I suggested it.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I appreciate and respect your reasons to code the way you code and at the end of the day it's likely that less than 10% of the people who use the program will want to pop the hood and see how it works. For the record, I'm just finishing up a semester where two of the key assigments involved using multiple third party software packages only for an update between the assignments to cause rampant compatibility issues for everyone, so I can relate to this frustration.<br /> <br /> I just can't pass up the chance to start some &quot;My Favourite Language Is Better Than Your Favourite Language&quot; ribbing, and I don't even really like Java.<br /> <br /> Best of luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T16:03:33-07:00","id":1083736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nilihum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1083642#post1083642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know, that's why I suggested it.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I appreciate and respect your reasons to code the way you code and at the end of the day it's likely that less than 10% of the people who use the program will want to pop the hood and see how it works. For the record, I'm just finishing up a semester where two of the key assigments involved using multiple third party software packages only for an update between the assignments to cause rampant compatibility issues for everyone, so I can relate to this frustration.<br /> <br /> I just can't pass up the chance to start some &quot;My Favourite Language Is Better Than Your Favourite Language&quot; ribbing, and I don't even really like Java.<br /> <br /> Best of luck.</div> </div> </div> </div>He's the coder, I'm just the public relations/management. So to speak.<br /> <br /> Though your assessment on how much overlap there is between programmers and Exalted fans is basically what I've been trying to tell him for months. He started believing me only recently.<br /> <br /> Though in his case, he likes Clojure because basically it's &quot;solving philosophical problems and paradoxes to code&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T08:24:10-07:00","id":1087711,"title":"","content":"He doesn't have to learn emacs if he doesn't want to. Was his project created using leiningen or maven? I know intellij gives the option to use both but if he's used leiningen it *should* just be a matter of updating the project.clj and copying over the src directory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12096-uncletaco","name":"uncletaco","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T05:47:45-07:00","id":1089085,"title":"","content":"So, any way to have a peek at the &quot;finished, workable&quot; Beta? Am really curious. You know, as a (potential) user. Don't know shit about coding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T15:01:36-07:00","id":1089984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>uncletaco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1087711#post1087711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He doesn't have to learn emacs if he doesn't want to. Was his project created using leiningen or maven? I know intellij gives the option to use both but if he's used leiningen it *should* just be a matter of updating the project.clj and copying over the src directory.</div> </div> </div> </div>In his case he tried it, the problem comes when Cursive parses his code.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I am a layman and therefore not an expert.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cheshire Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1089085#post1089085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, any way to have a peek at the &quot;finished, workable&quot; Beta? Am really curious. You know, as a (potential) user. Don't know shit about coding.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that's the issue. The code functions but the compiler does not.<br /> <br /> At the same time, look forward soon, we've got some help from another coder friend of his whom Kenai says is a &quot;wiz kid&quot; when it comes to coding, and he'll be having a lot of free time soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 05-08-2017, 06:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T19:02:51-07:00","id":1090089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated?p=1089984#post1089984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well that's the issue. The code functions but the compiler does not.<br /> <br /> At the same time, look forward soon, we've got some help from another coder friend of his whom Kenai says is a &quot;wiz kid&quot; when it comes to coding, and he'll be having a lot of free time soon.</div> </div> </div> </div>No chance of you guys uploading the source code to the Bitbucket repository? Has the repository been updated recently, actually?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-12T00:07:56-07:00","id":1091445,"title":"","content":"SHE LIVES! ANATHEMA IS BACK ON TRACK BABY!<br /> <br /> Kenai is now working on usable, workable UI (To clarify, we've got a design we like, it's hooking the code into that design I'd spoiled earlier is the issue), and we had to dump a good chunk of code as we'd been doing it, cutting out some functionality that we'll have to implement later in a different fashion, but Anathema is reincarnated folks! IntelliJ is working, we've had to roll back to a previous version of our core software engine (Which is named Lytek for those of you who are amused by that sort of thing.) and Anathema will be moving forward again, full steam ahead.<br /> <br /> Basically the issue had largely been one of missing an obvious mistake by virtue of mental exhaustion. For the people who actually care about that kind of thing, he'd tried to go from Clojure CLJ to CLJC without completely understanding CLJC.<br /> <br /> But now Anathema will have an available beta version sometime soon. Look forward to it people. We're back on track, the coalbox is full and we're pulling out of the station.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 05-12-2017, 03:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-12T01:17:59-07:00","id":1091452,"title":"","content":"I'm so happy to hear this! I hope to beta-test this program soon, and I can't wait to show this program to my circle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-12T01:57:59-07:00","id":1091461,"title":"","content":"That sounds amazing. Keep up the good work, and give Kenai our best wishes.<br /> <br /> PS- Yes, I am one of those amused by the &quot;Lytek&quot; coincidence. So thanks for that gem! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2103-talosx","name":